%% title: Approval of a contact change
%% desc: An admin edits a contact. If the person is shared across schools the change waits, a link is sent, and the person confirms with a code or declines.
flowchart LR
  A["Admin edits<br/>contact"]:::admin --> Q{"Shared<br/>person?"}
  Q -->|No| X["Changes<br/>at once"]
  Q -->|Yes| W["Pending"]:::note
  W -.-> L["Link sent"]:::note
  L --> V["Person<br/>approves"]:::person
  V --> K["Code"]
  K --> Y["Confirmed"]:::person
  V --> N["Declined"]:::person
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
  classDef person fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
